# Step Instance

Work in a project cycle. An instance of a process step.

◇

attributes:
    - key: num
      name: Num
      details: Order of this step instance within the cycle.
      rules: "[0 .. unconstrained] at 1 unit"
      type_spec: Nat

associations:
    - name: Instance Of
      details: Process step this step instance is an instance of.
      from_multiplicity: any
      to_class_key: process/process/step
      to_multiplicity: "1"
    - name: Has Tasks
      details: Tasks of this step instance. Each task is an instance of a process step task.
      from_multiplicity: "1"
      to_class_key: task
      to_multiplicity: any
